{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t即將舉行APEC峰會的深圳，被譽為「中國設計之都」。文化創意業亦是深圳四大支柱產業之一，佔全市GDP約8%。<br/>\n<br/>\n有進駐園區的香港藝術家說，深圳文化配套齊全，創作概念能夠很快變成作品；亦有設計師舉辦非物質文化遺產展覽，希望讓更多參加峰會的人認識中國文化。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T04:55:58.723402+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T04:40:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T08:32:03.442485+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T04:49:28.508283+00:00","content_hash":"34ec18cc2b36b2ae6ac46a5002af413c0b11a4c2132d124b220d107c2236c975","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}